<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Packer's PBL half year profit falls.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Packer's PBL half year profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>	   (million A$ unless stated)</p>
